DESCRIPTION:Oklahoma settlement abatement grants for 3-year projects. Priority strategies include contingency management\, integrated care and MOUD. A university or school district applicant could contract More Therapy for MORE training\, since subgrants are barred but contracting for services is allowed. Treat as a weak fit that only works through a partner.\n\nPath: Line-item · Priority 2.0\nhttps://oklahoma.gov/oag/resources/grants/opioid-abatement-grant.html
